{"event_type":"review","id":"ef8730f795b266fd8df3b5ad9307e162ab1ae7b0cff6aa55ffc29fa78a40064a","occurred_at":"2026-11-09T08:01:56Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0aca717b4d2c3fbb8270a49c98bafa7abff21e12e4f394df42190292f43bf903","sha256":"0aca717b4d2c3fbb8270a49c98bafa7abff21e12e4f394df42190292f43bf903"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/66ea9cc48656f17df202cd2aaaee031d07e5fb23dd6275dee6cb83f813cf8a7f","sha256":"66ea9cc48656f17df202cd2aaaee031d07e5fb23dd6275dee6cb83f813cf8a7f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/af8ce7eadc1524211aeade50e44a39b27cdace0b35223bc979e974d7e297e64d","sha256":"af8ce7eadc1524211aeade50e44a39b27cdace0b35223bc979e974d7e297e64d"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/06baed07542e3018d1f105e7fafd17a3c85c6059ab8c0f2e9845eb136aaf7721","sha256":"06baed07542e3018d1f105e7fafd17a3c85c6059ab8c0f2e9845eb136aaf7721"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e3d22925e540bd598dee5bb6183f4e2e98e7f4d672710dc67f7d3aeaa6035907","sha256":"e3d22925e540bd598dee5bb6183f4e2e98e7f4d672710dc67f7d3aeaa6035907"}],"attempt_id":"7f9cdadb189b4c6454b8bf22d0d0f9d6178e29f4a0d6f650e48504345d5b9683:0:1","base":"06adf0e04a991fa13874bc31e52f07f695474221","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"2e41dd311c124704a3de71beb73e1088d23363a4","body":"**`CREDENTIAL_NAME` does not match some common credential names.**\n\n`scripts/lib/build-env.mjs:14` has no entry for `passphrase` or `access_key`. These names pass through to the build child unscrubbed:\n\n- `SSH_PASSPHRASE`, `GPG_PASSPHRASE`, and `KEY_PASSPHRASE`. `password|passwd` does not match `passphrase`.\n- `ACCESS_KEY` and `ACCESS_KEY_ID`. They are named like `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`. The key-class group lists only `api|private|encryption|signing`.\n\nThe module's stated purpose is to remove \"every credential-bearing variable\". The values of these variables are not URLs, so `URL_WITH_CREDENTIAL` does not catch them.\n\nAdd both names to the pattern. If the build needs `ACCESS_KEY_ID`-style identifiers, drop `access` and keep `passphrase`.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-  /token|secret|password|passwd|credential|(?:api|private|encryption|signing)_?key|auth/i;\n+  /token|secret|pass(?:word|wd|phrase)|credential|(?:api|access|private|encryption|signing)_?key|auth/i;\n```\n</details>","id":"5c8e74bf04e587a6edd085c3240ee4cfb16ba96e0dd1ccada7bf857369665a8a","intervals":[[13,14]],"path":"scripts/lib/build-env.mjs","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"`CREDENTIALNAME` does not match some common credential names."}],"head":"1164b85dc639d119b80992d18f6fcc11e4f5ff75","head_tree":"508004493f055962e8cda86731fcfbf07ecb0af4","input_scope":[{"blob":"2e41dd311c124704a3de71beb73e1088d23363a4","intervals":[[1,41]],"path":"scripts/lib/build-env.mjs"}],"job_id":"7f9cdadb189b4c6454b8bf22d0d0f9d6178e29f4a0d6f650e48504345d5b9683:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"2e41dd311c124704a3de71beb73e1088d23363a4","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/lib/build-env.mjs","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"2e41dd311c124704a3de71beb73e1088d23363a4","intervals":[[3,5],[7,14],[23,29],[38,38]],"path":"scripts/lib/build-env.mjs"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"2e41dd311c124704a3de71beb73e1088d23363a4","intervals":[[3,5],[7,14],[23,29],[38,38]],"path":"scripts/lib/build-env.mjs"}],"scope_digest":"eb48e22970b0d29b22dee783734e3353ccb4c4244265278fad1999d9b5347dc7","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-7f9cdadb189b4c6454b8bf22d0d0f9d6178e2